WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:30.966
How do we combine scores with unlike meanings?

00:00:30.966 --> 00:01:03.380
Keep record identity while recording position

00:01:03.380 --> 00:01:36.951
One over the constant plus the rank

00:01:36.951 --> 00:02:04.625
A is near the top of both lists

00:02:04.625 --> 00:02:32.970
C combines third place with first place

00:02:32.970 --> 00:03:05.966
B and D receive one contribution each

00:03:05.966 --> 00:03:32.800
The four identities now have one order

00:03:32.800 --> 00:04:08.700
The constant is not a result count
